{"id":"vod_sn_37335","vodId":"37335","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"天堂之吻","name_cn":"天堂之吻","date":"2005-01-01","year":"2005","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/c5ed4c80f865b0e1259b666044d4095a.jpg"},"summary":"早阪紫（山田优 配音）是一个普通的高中生，以考上理想大学为终极目标的她每日都奔波在学校和补习班之间。一次偶然中，紫结识了个性超级糟糕，狂妄自大又目中无人的矢泽艺术学院服装设计系学生小泉让二（滨田贤二 配音），“来成为我的模特吧”，让二说出了让紫目瞪口呆的话来。　　通过让二，紫认识了一群有趣的朋友们。个性单纯天真的幸田实和子（松本真理香 配音）；表面上看起来桀骜不驯，但实际上非常专一可靠的吉他手永濑岚（水谷俊介 配音）以及男儿身少女心的伊莎贝拉（山本大助 配音），在和这些朋友们相处的过程中，紫渐渐的找到了自己人生的目标，同时，她和让二之间，也萌生出了缠绵的感情。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:51:17","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/HvLppUYBw21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/A2zmFLmiSn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/tvgUwXrKdA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/1ipHj0gJdp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/xc78Lb3sAk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ci9Pvbe1cg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Zr6VL3YLAk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/r4xieJhpT91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jYJB99Ncb81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/xe2pcXfh701/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/W7dHbrxPHv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/4cg4dvnEzy1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:11.945Z"}